# Ripgrep / fd / ag ignore file (auto-discovered).
#
# These patterns are filtered from broad searches by default. They cover
# generated code, layout/proof artifacts, legacy-GPU dirs, compiled
# binaries, and other content with no semantic value for code search.
#
# Files listed here remain tracked in git and readable directly by path
# (Read tool, cat, less, targeted `rg path/to/file`). To bypass these
# rules for a one-off search (e.g. when actually inspecting generated
# code), pass `--no-ignore` or `-uu` to ripgrep.
#
# Syntax is gitignore-style. Patterns are matched anywhere in the tree
# unless anchored with a leading `/`.
#
# Note: `target/` is intentionally omitted — it is covered by .gitignore,
# which ripgrep honors by default.

# --- Generated source (Rust + CUDA) ---
generated/
compiled_circuits/
tools/generator/output/

# --- Proof, witness, and layout artifacts ---
prover/test_proofs/
*_gkr_proof.json
*_layout_gkr.json
*_layout_no_caches_gkr.json
*_preprocessed_layout_gkr.json
*_preprocessed_layout_no_caches_gkr.json
*_ssa_gkr.json
*_witness
*.vk.json

# --- Legacy GPU code (kept for reference/diffing, not active) ---
gpu_prover_old/
gpu_witness_eval_generator_old/

# --- Compiled binaries ---
*.elf
*.bin
*.text

# --- Profiling / visualization artifacts ---
verifier/gkr_flamegraph_*.svg

# --- Large reference docs ---
unpriv-isa-asciidoc.pdf
